,10800],"A little sprout grows.":[22,89424,9216],"The plant gets bigger.":[22,98640,8496],"Now it is a flower!":[22,107136,8496],"My day":[22,115632,4608],"The sun comes up in the morning.":[22,120240,11232],"It is bright at noon.":[22,131472,8352],"The sun goes down in the evening.":[22,139824,12240],"At night, we sleep.":[22,152064,9360],"A cat can fly.":[22,161424,8208],"Fish live in water.":[22,169632,8496],"The sun is cold.":[22,178128,7200],"A dog can talk like people.":[22,185328,11232],"Birds lay eggs.":[22,196560,6912],"Plants grow from seeds.":[22,203472,9936],"Cows give milk.":[22,213408,7632],"An elephant fits in a cup.":[22,221040,10656],"Ice is cold.":[22,231696,6768],"A car can drive to the moon.":[22,238464,10512],"People need sleep.":[22,248976,7344],"A pig can drive a truck.":[22,256320,9648],"Rain falls from clouds.":[22,265968,10656],"Bees make honey.":[22,276624,7200],"The moon is made of cheese.":[22,283824,9648],"A robot has feelings like you.":[22,293472,12960],"Someone online asks for your name. What do you do?":[22,306432,19728],"Ask a grown-up":[22,326160,7632],"Tell them":[22,333792,4320],"Great choice! Always ask a grown-up before sharing anything online.":[22,338112,28224],"Your friend is sad. What do you do?":[22,366336,15264],"Give a hug":[22,381600,5760],"Laugh":[23,0,3744],"That's kind! A hug helps a friend feel better.":[23,3744,19872],"Someone knocks on the door. What do you do?":[23,23616,16416],"Get a grown-up":[23,40032,6192],"Open it":[23,46224,4032],"Smart! A grown-up opens the door.":[23,50256,16416],"Oops, you spilled milk. What do you do?":[23,66672,17712],"Help clean up":[23,84384,5616],"Run away":[23,90000,5184],"Good job! Everyone makes mistakes. We fix them together.":[23,95184,26784],"You and a friend want the same toy. What do you do?":[23,121968,20592],"Take turns":[23,142560,6048],"Grab it":[23,148608,4176],"Yes! Taking turns is fair.":[23,152784,14544],"A computer says something strange. What do you do?":[23,167328,21024],"Check with a grown-up":[23,188352,7920],"Believe it":[23,196272,4176],"Smart thinking! Computers can be wrong. We check with a grown-up.":[23,200448,28512],"Family love":[23,228960,5760],"Mommy loves you!":[23,234720,6912],"Daddy loves you!":[23,241632,7200],"Grandma loves you!":[23,248832,7632],"Grandpa loves you!":[23,256464,7776],"Your family loves you so much!":[23,264240,13248],"Big hug!":[23,277488,5184],"Kisses for you!":[23,282672,6480],"Sweet dreams. We love you.":[23,289152,15840],"I am…":[23,304992,4320],"I am brave!":[23,309312,6768],"I am smart!":[23,316080,5760],"I am strong!":[23,321840,6768],"I can do it!":[23,328608,5328],"I am kind.":[23,333936,6624],"I am special.":[23,340560,6336],"I am loved.":[23,346896,6624],"I learn new things every day.":[23,353520,10656],"I try my best!":[23,364176,7920],"I am a good friend.":[23,372096,7344],"Mistakes help me learn.":[23,379440,8784],"I love to ask questions.":[23,388224,11088],"Good manners":[24,0,5328],"Please":[24,5328,4320],"Thank you!":[24,9648,5184],"You're welcome.":[24,14832,5904],"Hello!":[24,20736,3744],"Goodbye!":[24,24480,4608],"Good morning!":[24,29088,5040],"Good night!":[24,34128,3888],"I'm sorry.":[24,38016,5472],"Excuse me.":[24,43488,7056],"Let's share!":[24,50544,4608],"Let's take turns.":[24,55152,7776],"Gentle hands.":[24,62928,7056],"Wash your hands.":[24,69984,7056],"Brush your teeth.":[24,77040,5760],"Let's clean up!":[24,82800,5616],"Inside voice, please.":[24,88416,9792],"A. A is for apple.":[24,98208,10224],"Which one starts with A?":[24,108432,8784],"B. B is for bear.":[24,117216,10080],"Which one starts with B?":[24,127296,9072],"C. C is for cat.":[24,136368,10368],"Which one starts with C?":[24,146736,9072],"D. D is for dog.":[24,155808,11232],"Which one starts with D?":[24,167040,9504],"E. E is for elephant.":[24,176544,12240],"Which one starts with E?":[24,188784,8640],"F. F is for frog.":[24,197424,13536],"Which one starts with F?":[24,210960,9360],"G. G is for gi